sequenceDiagram
  participant User as Staff / Student
  participant BFF as Next.js BFF
  participant API as Spring Identity API
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  User->>BFF: Login credentials over HTTPS
  BFF->>API: POST /auth/login (server side)
  API->>DB: Check account, password hash, lockout, scopes
  DB-->>API: Verified account + assigned scopes
  API-->>BFF: Short-lived RS256 access JWT + opaque rotating refresh token
  BFF-->>User: Secure HttpOnly SameSite session cookie
  User->>BFF: Protected request with cookie + CSRF token
  BFF->>API: Bearer JWT on server-side request
  API->>API: Signature, issuer, aud, exp, scope + resource ownership
  API-->>BFF: Authorized result only
  Note over BFF,API: Refresh rotates opaque token; reuse revokes family
